  "system": {
    "identifier": "iburi-fume-substitution",
    "description": "<p>You quickly morph your body into smoke to avoid being struck by an enemy's assault. Increase your AC by +4 for the triggering attack and each subsequent attack until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>For each attack that misses you as a result of this jutsu you may force the creature that missed, to make a Constitution saving throw as you release a plume of smoke into their eyes. On a failed save, they gain a rank of Dazzled or Envenomed, your choice.</p>\n<p>If you are currently receiving the benefits of the Smoke Style stance, you can move up to 10 feet when an attack misses you.</p>",
